{"symbol":"FNTN.DE","area":"europe","updated":"2026-11-09T20:09:11Z","info":{"address1":"Hollerstraße 126","city":"Büdelsdorf","zip":"24782","country":"Germany","phone":"49 4331 69 1000","website":"https://www.freenet.ag","industry":"Telecom Services","industryKey":"telecom-services","industryDisp":"Telecom Services","sector":"Communication Services","sectorKey":"communication-services","sectorDisp":"Communication Services","longBusinessSummary":"freenet AG provides telecommunications, broadcasting, and multimedia services for mobile communications/mobile internet, and digital lifestyle sectors in Germany. It operates through Mobile Communications, TV and Media, and Other/Holding segments. The Mobile Communications segment engages in marketing mobile communications services, which include voice and data services from the mobile network operators; planning, set up, installation, and maintenance services for WiFi networks; and selling and distribution of mobile devices, as well as offering additional services for mobile data communications and digital lifestyle. This segment also provides network-independent services and tariffs; tariffs of the network operators; and freenet Internet, an app-based Internet product. The TV and Media segment is involved in the planning, project management, construction, operation, service, and marketing services for broadcast-related solutions for business clients in the broadcasting and media sectors; and the provision of services to end users in the field of DVB-T2 and IPTV. The Other/Holding segment offers portal services, such as e-commerce/advertising services; payment services; various digital products and entertainment formats for downloading and displaying, as well as use on mobile devices; communication development solutions, IT services, and other services; narrowband voice services; data services; and distribution services. Additionally, the company engages in the business that develops and operates a platform for IP Entertainment Services. The company offers live TV, video on demand, personalized content, and a media library of films and series. The company was formerly known as telunico holding AG and changed its name to freenet AG in March 2005. freenet AG was incorporated in 2005 and is headquartered in Büdelsdorf, Germany.","fullTimeEmployees":2798,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Robin John Andres Harries","age":43,"title":"CEO & Chairman of the Executive Board","yearBorn":1982,"fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":1068000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Ingo  Arnold","age":60,"title":"Deputy Chairman of Executive Board & CFO","yearBorn":1965,"fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":1052000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Stephan A. Esch","age":56,"title":"Chief Technology Officer","yearBorn":1969,"fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":2090000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Nicole  Engenhardt-Gille","age":57,"title":"CHRO & Head of ESG","yearBorn":1968,"fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":510000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Antonius Reiner Fromme","age":51,"title":"Chief Customer Experience Officer","yearBorn":1974,"fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":1426000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Tim-Frederik  Oehr","title":"Head of Investor Relations","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Nadline  Mette","title":"Head of PR","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"auditRisk":1,"boardRisk":6,"compensationRisk":4,"shareHolderRightsRisk":1,"overallRisk":4,"governanceEpochDate":1793491200,"compensationAsOfEpochDate":1767139200,"executiveTeam":[],"maxAge":86400,"priceHint":2,"previousClose":23.34,"open":23.36,"dayLow":23.2,"dayHigh":23.5,"regularMarketPreviousClose":23.34,"regularMarketOpen":23.36,"regularMarketDayLow":23.2,"regularMarketDayHigh":23.5,"dividendRate":2.07,"dividendYield":8.87,"exD